## Best Practices
1. Update tracking documents regularly (at least weekly)
2. Use consistent naming conventions for all events
3. Archive completed events rather than deleting them
4. Include contact information for all team members
5. Link to relevant external resources where appropriate
6. Maintain version history for significant document changes
7. Ensure all deadlines are clearly marked with owners assigned 